      "id": "claim_0391a247f6e84f1fb3d5f869c427fb84",
      "statement": "The Harbor eval freezes six job sources: RemoteOK, Himalayas, Remotive, and Jobicy (JSON APIs mapped by hostname in HOSTS), Workable (HTML at jobs.workable.com via workable_fixture), and Getro (api.getro.com POST search via frozen_post). Any unmapped host or unfrozen Workable path raises RuntimeError, ensuring network isolation and requiring fixtures for any newly added source in agent.py.",
