    {
      "id": "claim_76a0cb7f1a754496bf67b28dca3c3f5d",
      "statement": "Network isolation is enforced by a Docker Compose overlay (evals/configs/no-network.yaml sets network_mode: none on the main service) passed via --extra-docker-compose, while task.toml declares network_mode = 'public' because Harbor's no-network policy is unavailable on WSL2 hosts; the overlay is the enforcement, not the declaration.",
